</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 6:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Very good incite B. and I believe feet have been dragging for a long time, Someone said something odd to me yesterday. I was asking about a cold case and they said that they just started going thru them again from that time period. Back then they had no reason to connect any of these Cases to BTK, now they are being  reevaluated. By new officers that must start over fresh. I feel the only way we are going to be satisfied, is by finding the answer&#39;s ourselves.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
